Z||000012||artherd||07-06-2001||10:22 AM||||uh.... my younger brother has an 1998 Civic EX Coupe.  It is bone stock, as is my formula.<P>There's no comparison, I could start out in 3rd and still beat him (both cars are 5-speeds incidentally. Mine is an 88 Formula.)<P>Also, I have a 15.7 timeslip here somewhere, which I will scan when I get around to finding it.<P>But please, let's settle this civic issue, stock, they lose.  Sorry.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
